  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: KoboldHeartstrikeSpearTeam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Kobold Heartstrike Spear Team
  role: 3
  description: An anti-tank squad of kobolds conditioned for suicidal bravery. While
    this team can clear almost any tank in the galaxy their frail nature makes them
    vulnerable to any infantry coordinating with armor. Each of the five kobolds
    carries a Heartstrike Spear (5 damage, penetration 6, 30 m), enough to do 7 damage
    to any tank, but with 5 health and no armor they fall to rifle fire. A Specialist,
    so you can field more than one.
